Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody and Submarimon found\Nthe Digimon Emperor's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,underwater base and freed\Nall of his prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they were inside the base,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we saw a giant dark whirlpool\Nthat our Digimon sense was evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I saw our old nemesis, Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He almost destroyed us once before, so to\Nmake sure that it wouldn't happen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally gave Ken a piece of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just then, Ken unleashed Chimera-mon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a Digimon he created from the\Nstrongest parts of other Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not as strong\Nas he thinks he is either.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\pos(317,320)}Supreme Evolution! Golden Magnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go ahead and run but\Nthere's nowhere to hide soon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i will have control over\Nthe entire digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh master is this really what ken wants
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is terrible ken does a lot of\Ndamage from his flying rv even if
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it does look like a giant flying\Nslug and all those poor digimon they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't have a home anymore i'm tired\Nof bad things happening to good
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon why do i get my paws on chan\Nhe's destroying everything in his path
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:04:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he shows no signs of letting up\Nit's like he wants to burn every square
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inch of the digital world bite your\Ntongue that can't taste very good i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't care what it takes i'm going\Nto find a way to stop that thing tk's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right we have to destroy it no matter\Nwhat it costs us i think everyone agrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even when we all combine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still don't have the power to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit or give up, because nothing will\Nstop him until he runs out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Runs out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, you just gave\Nme an idea. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he's called chimera\Nmon he has kabuterrimon's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head and the wings of\Nboth Angemon and airdramon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon's tail and\NGarurumon's legs... He's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got graymon's body and\Nmetal graymon's hair
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Gokimon skull graymon's and debimon's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arms talk about a split\Npersonality gee it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good thing kari sent us\Nthese pictures so we can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get a good look at him\Nand the digimon emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,built this couldn't\Nyou've stayed with model
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,airplanes like the rest\Nof us that's it i'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroy him hey izzy how\Ndo i destroy him well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we do that we\Nfirst have to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how to get him to hold\Nstill how do we do that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his base is always moving\Nwe're getting another
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,email from cody izzy we\Nfound a pipeline that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will cross paths with\Nken's base i know you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can use this information\Nsomehow he has such
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,confidence in me what\Npipeline hey look what's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a picture of i'll\Ncheck oh i get it the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pipeline is connected to\Nthe offshore oil platform
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an oil pipeline pipeline\Ni've got it you figured
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out how to stop him actually\Nno but i needed an eight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-letter word for my crossword\Npuzzle stay on track oh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right actually i do have a\Nplan that If we're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope these guys can pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should build a monument to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a time\Nout from all the destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can start again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from the darkness. Who are\Nyou? I'm one of mine. Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watch your step or you might fall into a\Nhole you didn't even know who was there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master what's wrong are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I have Chimeramon, nothing\Ncan stop me from ruling this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even some stupid voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think anyone spotted us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go topside and scout\Nthe situation. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought,\Nlet's go below and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we have to follow\NIzzy's plan. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot to break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd these flames come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get the fire extinguisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very efficient, Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were pretty hot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I, invisible?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sue me. I don't have dragon's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you guys try flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Izzy's plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the first part of it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, while he's busy taking\Ncare of his emergency, we'll sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that small door?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that's the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rage Roman! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I good or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he keeps telling himself that,\Nhe might start to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least someone will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well guys we've done everything\Nwe can now what there's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only one thing left to do now\Nyeah let's hit the sushi bar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,part one of the plan went\Nwell great will they be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're in the most dangerous\Npossible place we're just gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to trust them this time\Nthey're on their own good
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,luck you guys we better get\Nready for a long night i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think any of us are going to\Nsleep i bet the digimon emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't and i know davis and\Nthe others won't sleep either
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm exhausted let's stop and sleep not\Nyet let's keep going a little further
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey guys look there's a light at the\Nend of the tunnel couldn't you think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of something a little more original\Nhey look at that wow it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something out of a science fiction\Nmovie yeah and i'm the hot shot pilot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who rescues princess carrie from the\Nbad space guys he said Science fiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not complete fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I bet he gets great\Nreception with that TV antenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he must get all the\Nunderground stations with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the engine room is. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come the engine room's never on\Nthe same floor as the front door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Master, we have more guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I put together\Nanother hors d 'oeuvre tray?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finish off those\Nkids without leaving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, back on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least they're small.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me they're\Nnot here to welcome us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's right. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll welcome them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eagle Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Jewelry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's leave while the ghosts are spooked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you can't play soccer in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's Chimeramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More Bakemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he can't do, Bylan, by the dozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were almost in the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you and the others go and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimeramon is really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to take all of us to\Nfight, and it might get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to stay clear, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save us some snacks for\Nwhen this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hide over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boulder Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eagle Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marine, win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geekpiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they weren't even hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care who he hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's totally out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, at this rate, he'll\Ndestroy the whole base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had no effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:14:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They used their best attacks and he\Ndoesn't have a single scratch on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just nothing we can do\Nright now, Cody, except watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't take much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got that shrinking seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, oh no! David!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demi-Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon! Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those little Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:15:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was at that soccer game\Nwhen I first met those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so little. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just like human babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought of it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimeramon! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with those kids on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our plan didn't work because our\NDigimon weren't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you just have to fall back,\Ncome up with a new plan, and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they don't have\Nenough strength to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not! Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, we can't just\Ngive up and leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might not ever get a\Nchance like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do we know he won't\Nstart attacking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, he's just standing there\Nlike a big, ugly, stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish what we came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible. Kari's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of our Digimon have returned\Nto their in-training forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't forget what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to sit around and watch as this\Nmix-and-match monster destroyed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't matter who got his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about the rest of you, but I\Ncan't stand by and let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if none of you want to go with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm going in alone because\NI refuse to give up until
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing has completely\Ndestroyed once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you, Davis. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, do you really have to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, let me put on my safety belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, that's not a safety\Nbelt, that's my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this wasn't a good idea. So\Nwhat do we do now? Well, I guess it's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our turn right if davis thinks\Nhe's gonna take all the credit for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this he can forget it yeah right\Nhe'd take credit for inventing the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wheel chimera mon don't let them\Nget away it's the digimon emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Meramon, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Meramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that weird voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, what's wrong? Ken? Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The powers of darkness mean\Nnothing to me. I'm still the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:18:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruler of this world i knew ken\Nwas doing things he shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been doing i was just\None time he would listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me once i find chimeramon\Nnothing can stop me now i'm the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only one who can protect him\Nokay wormon let's see what
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're made of ken must have\Ntried to control the powers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of darkness but it was too\Nmuch for him okay everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to get to\Nthe engine room and destroy it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you climb and I'll sit on your\Nhead That looks like the engine room
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way I know who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way The engine room is over here,\Nfollow me Do I look stupid to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, this is some kind of trap No,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen, you have to believe\Nme This isn't a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to save my master\NHe created this awful Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimera-mon, and now he\Ncan't control it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid things have gone\Ntoo far and I'm losing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that if you destroy this\Nplace, I'll be able to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to help you if you'll help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.69,0:19:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do it. You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm not as big a\Njerk as people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the whole room is\Nfull of some kind of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's\Ncoming from that black thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken found that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow the power from it\Nis making this base move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so all we have to do is take it\Naway, and then the base will stop moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never be able to lift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power source!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a weird feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You digivolved! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it looks like a golden digi-egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this means that it's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mom, think you can\Nhandle it? Yeah! Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden armor energized!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mom, golden armor! Kissy bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the captain, Spiral Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, dude, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This changes everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The balance of power has shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait! Look!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to say it I don't\Nknow what you're doing I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what you're doing. It's not a\Nlie. This is like a sound effect.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling good, and I'm feeling good.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.58,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling good, but I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.58,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the future of my wind.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the world will open the door.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.39,0:23:03.40,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx140\fscy140\pos(324,327)}Goodbye, Ken-chan...

